  },
  {
    "editor_id": "EECExemptionDocument",
    "form_id": "060009D9|exchangeCurrency_enhanced.esp",
    "index": 1,
    "type": "BOOK DESC",
    "original": "<p align=\"center\"><b>Exemption Certificate</b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\">The Eastern Empire Company exempts the holder of this document from exchange tax.</p>",
    "string": "<p align=\"center\"><b>Certificado de Exención</b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\">La Compañía del Imperio del Este exime al portador de este documento del impuesto de intercambio.</p>",
    "status": "TranslationComplete"
  },
  {
    "editor_id": "SkoomaBook",
    "form_id": "06000A66|exchangeCurrency_enhanced.esp",
    "index": 1,
    "type": "BOOK FULL",
    "original": "Smuggler journal",
    "string": "Diario del contrabandista",
    "status": "TranslationComplete"
  },
  {
    "editor_id": "SkoomaBook",
    "form_id": "06000A66|exchangeCurrency_enhanced.esp",
    "index": 1,
    "type": "BOOK DESC",
    "original": "<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><div align=\"left\">\r\n\r\nThis cabin will be perfect for preparing my mixtures. The old grain mill outside will allow me to grind the sugar cane I bought from the apothecary.\n\nI've managed to assemble a refining vat, all I have to do now is distil the moon sugar.\r\n\nFinding customers won't be easy as the authorities are on the lookout for skooma trafficking. Perhaps the Khajiits in the caravan will be interested in what I have to offer... I'll have to find them.\r\n\r\n</div></font>",
    "string": "<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><div align=\"left\">\r\n\r\nEsta cabaña sera perfecta para preparar mis mezclas. El viejo molino de grano afuera me permitirá moler la cana de azúcar que compre al boticario.\r\n\r\nHe logrado ensamblar una cuba de refinado, solo me falta destilar el azúcar lunar.\r\n\r\nNo sera fácil encontrar clientes, ya que las autoridades están al acecho del trafico de skooma. Quizá los Khajiitas de la caravana estén interesados en lo que tengo para ofrecer... tendré que encontrarlos.\r\n\r\n</div></font>",
    "status": "TranslationComplete"
  },
